0,Kagoro - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagoro,"ⓘ) (also Gworog, Gwoot; Hausa: Kagoro) is a large town in southern Kaduna State, Middle Belt Nigeria. It is located in the Kaura Local Government Area. [1] Gworok is a Christian-dominated town. It is home to many missionaries, attracted by the cool weather and relatively high altitude. [2] Gworog has a post office. [3] Other places in Kagoro are Malagum and Tum.",Kagoro,Niger-Congo
