9,"Aegworok People of Southern Kaduna: History, Culture, & Traditions",https://rexclarkeadventures.com/aegworok-people-southern-kaduna/,"Where are the Aegworok people located? The Aegworok, also known as the Kagoro people, is located in the Kaura Local Government Area of Kaduna State, northern Nigeria, a region noted for its sacred hills and deep-rooted cultural heritage. What language does the Aegworok speak? They speak Gworok, a dialect within the Tyap language cluster.",Kagoro,Niger-Congo
